  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Global.Text 74374 'Hooligan Brawling Club!' (title), 75440 'Hooligans are running a brawling club and kidnapping travelers! Head in and shut this club down!' (card), 75441 'Defeat all the hooligans.' (goal); icon 310; 5100401 'Hooligan'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 49 ('Hooligan Brawling Club! (the live random encounter: the hooligans' brawling club)'): starter Npc 4156, scene sg_random_encounter_01 (zone 1239), the same entry and exit as Id 58 (our 14021), difficulty 1, 15 coins. Waves: 3x Npc 4154 Hooligan; 2x 4160 Hooligan (female body, model 518) and 2x 46002 Hooligan Brawler; the 46079 Hooligan Scrapper boss and 3x 4154. Every spot here is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "legacy-data",
      "evidence": "FreeRealms-Legacy FabledRealms.lua:2818-2822 spawns 4152 Billie JoBob, 4153 Billie's Trunk, 4154 and 4155 Hooligans, and 4156 'Hooligan Brawling Club!' (Npcs.json, sg_spawner_human_01.adr) together near Jones's camp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "FR_Mob Hooligan Delinquent: 'Battle Starter, Monster, Quest'; Battles: 'Hooligan Brawling Club!'; Related Quests: 'Brawler: Delinquent Dilemma', 'Contract: All Around Win'; found in the wilds surrounding Crossroads."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) L1192: Npc 4154 is definition 4154 (hooligan_delinquent), and Npc 4160 (same name, female body) shares it, so every Delinquent defeated here counts for 3030007. Npc 46002 is the Tavern Cellar's hooligan_brawler (1404301) and 46079 the Hooligan Scrapper (950040), the boss woken when wave 3 starts, as in 14021. Rules, the L1189 hooligan barks and the prize wheel copy Hooligan Bullies! (14021), the same family and scene: the wiki gives this battle no wheel of its own. Not proven in the client yet: this scene needs one native load."
    }
  ]
